effect|ARMOR_FLAT_FOR_LOW_BASE_ARMOR|1.0	0	Increases armor by up to <good>400/700/900/1200</good>. Hulls with less base armor gain more: the bonus falls to <good>150/300/400/500</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor (frigate/destroyer/cruiser/capital ship). Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
effect|ARMOR_FLAT_FOR_LOW_BASE_ARMOR|10.0	0	Increases armor by up to <good>4000/7000/9000/12000</good>. Hulls with less base armor gain more: the bonus falls to <good>1500/3000/4000/5000</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor (frigate/destroyer/cruiser/capital ship). Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
effect|ARMOR_FLAT_FOR_LOW_BASE_ARMOR|12.5	0	Increases armor by up to <good>5000/8750/11250/15000</good>. Hulls with less base armor gain more: the bonus falls to <good>1875/3750/5000/6250</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor (frigate/destroyer/cruiser/capital ship). Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
effect|ARMOR_FLAT_FOR_LOW_BASE_ARMOR|100.0	0	Increases armor by up to <good>40000/70000/90000/120000</good>. Hulls with less base armor gain more: the bonus falls to <good>15000/30000/40000/50000</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor (frigate/destroyer/cruiser/capital ship). Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
effect|ARMOR_FLAT_FOR_LOW_BASE_ARMOR|-10.0	0	Increases armor by up to <good>-4000/-7000/-9000/-12000</good>. Hulls with less base armor gain more: the bonus falls to <good>-1500/-3000/-4000/-5000</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor (frigate/destroyer/cruiser/capital ship). Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
effect|ARMOR_FLAT_FOR_LOW_BASE_ARMOR|-12.5	0	Increases armor by up to <good>-5000/-8750/-11250/-15000</good>. Hulls with less base armor gain more: the bonus falls to <good>-1875/-3750/-5000/-6250</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor (frigate/destroyer/cruiser/capital ship). Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
