effect|PHASE_FIELD_CONTRIBUTION_PERCENT|1.0	0	Even if this ship isn't a phase ship, 1% of its sensor strength counts toward the fleet-wide detected-at range reduction that phase ships normally provide (see the Phase Field hull mod) - the more (and stronger-sensor) ships contribute, the less visible the fleet becomes, with diminishing returns. Only applies while the fleet's transponder is off.
